---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hi, I'm Inaya.</h1>
			<p>
				I'm 19, I've lived near Paris all my life, and I write C, Go and
				TypeScript because I want to know what's happening underneath. What
				pulls me is the bottom of the stack, runtimes and operating systems and
				the seam where firmware hands over to the OS.
			</p>
			<p>
				Before that came eleven years at EREA Toulouse-Lautrec and a fine arts
				degree I left in May 2025, and the art didn't leave with the degree.
			</p>
			<p>
				There's a much longer version on the <a href="/about">about page</a>.
				The <a href="/projects">projects page</a> is empty. I'll get to it.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
